default_in_repayment.text:
The Company has not defaulted in repayment of loans or borrowings to any lender during the year;

The Company has not been declared wilful defaulter by any bank or financial institution or 86 government or any government authority;

The company has not obtained any term loans during the year and hence reporting under clause 3(ix)(c) of the Order is not applicable;

On an overall examination of the standalone financial statements of the Company, funds raised on short- term basis have, prima facie, not been used during the year for long-term purposes by the Company;


On an overall examination of the standalone financial statements of the Company, the Company has not taken any funds from any entity or person on account of or to meet the obligations of its subsidiaries and hence reporting on clause 3(ix)(e) of the order is not applicable;


